        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_af02455cf9844dc6b285731d87a9f771",
      "statement": "The render hot path never touches the network; updating is an explicit `claudebar update` command, a deliberate design choice so the statusline hook stays offline and fast.",
