    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2fd1d501a0c44ec2bcdb90bcf48d76b2",
      "statement": "The update comparison is channel-aware via the `--channel` flag (default `stable`): stable compares against the newest stable release and only falls back to a prerelease when no stable release exists, while beta compares against the newest release across all channels; prereleases are only offered with --channel beta.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/cli.rs#L155-L157",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:848183fadad7e6e68dfcff99b5cdc6247f87bf7295c0b50e88aa31fdcda49cb3:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/update.rs#L25-L31",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8f9d435d1096588490babcb31e405f92983d470465f5595c85a759d7a77e5584:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/update.rs#L348-L368",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f754ed2ac9bd1577a16cfb9c5500b698c55b5682d08d06f60eace9c2e252433c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_736c9c279d8c409c9161693dbb2dc1a1",
      "statement": "Versions are CalVer with an optional -beta.N prerelease suffix; Version::parse accepts exactly N.N.N with an optional prerelease and returns None for malformed tags, and ordering follows semver semantics where a release beats any prerelease within the same major.minor.patch and prereleases compare numerically by beta level.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/update.rs#L55-L83",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b496baa5747cea7f286191dc045441cd37d54fe147db98097cb37ceb31d5e0e4:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/update.rs#L95-L125",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a175e24a8f5f592e6ce6d8189d93fc4cbd2cf8e16870a5bac45df02c8fa28bd6:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_af85bcf2da034308b9a4a8093cc9fcc6",
      "statement": "fetch_latest shells out to curl (with --fail --silent --show-error --location --max-time 15) rather than an HTTP dependency, since the render hot path never calls this code.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/update.rs#L168-L189",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f260fa757c0e2432d1de2c8430fbc552ab715363f16477a5c534a430e268aa78:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_98821c91dafe48bab5d785b6d3f3ab74",
      "statement": "fetch_latest returns UpdateError::Network when curl is unavailable, exits non-zero, or times out, and UpdateError::Parse when the response is not a JSON list of releases or contains no parseable CalVer tag.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/update.rs#L144-L153",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:155d6913b25027c8e13b9fb1d697f2c108e73ebd5169b425962046e3f73640a1:"
