        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_953ad18ebd41430391aa811765e9f6af",
      "statement": "The --check flag never exits 2 for update available and always exits 0 on success, making it safe inside set -e shells and && chains while still printing the result on stdout.",
