          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:36450ae78f96854430b5d41208b8e6e38924c88dbe5eb78f13e9d8decd09103a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f0675de2566541aca2b83cd491b0851f",
      "statement": "The update-notice segment is a pure formatter that renders the ahead glyph and cached version only when it is strictly newer than the running binary and shows nothing when there is no update; because it is the one segment that spawns a daily network check it stays opt-in and the sync command reports it instead of enabling it.",
